info.description:
Laravel API backed by real MySQL functions and stored procedures. Run the successful sale before the cancellation requests. Sample IDs are seeded by database/sql/02_insert_sample_data.sql.

Success response example: {"message":"Sale created.","data":{"sale_id":1,"total_amount":"3.00","sale_status":"COMPLETED"}}

Validation error example (422): {"message":"The given data was invalid.","errors":{"quantity":["The quantity field must be at least 1."]}}

Database business-rule error example (422): {"message":"Insufficient stock"}
